---
---

<section id="work" class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker" data-r>featured project</p>
    <h2 class="h2" data-r style="--d: 60ms">What I'm building right now.</h2>

    <article class="card feature" data-r>
      <div class="feature-copy">
        <div class="mini">
          <img src="/talkium/logo-icon.png" width="44" height="44" alt="" />
          <div><b>Talkium</b><span>talkium.gg</span></div>
        </div>
        <p>
          A voice and text platform with Discord's features and TeamSpeak's raw speed, made for gamers and
          streamers. I'm the founder and CEO, and I work on every layer of it.
        </p>
        <div class="stats">
          <div class="stat"><b style="font-family: var(--mono); font-weight: 400"><span data-ping>--</span><span class="u">ms</span></b><span>from you to this page</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><b>Rust</b><span>server and media</span></div>
        </div>
        <div><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://talkium.gg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit talkium.gg</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stage">
        <div class="stage-glow"></div>
        <div class="window">
          <img src="/talkium/space.webp" width="1704" height="1065" loading="lazy" alt="The Talkium desktop app: a space of servers, a chat with Mara, a calendar and a task list" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <div class="bento">
      <article class="card tile t-4" data-r>
        <h3>Chat and voice</h3>
        <p>Rooms, DMs and calls in a native Tauri 2 window, over a custom media server in Rust.</p>
        <div class="chips"><span class="chip">Tauri 2</span><span class="chip">SolidJS</span><span class="chip">str0m</span></div>
      </article>
      <article class="card tile t-4" data-r style="--d: 80ms">
        <h3>Streaming studio</h3>
        <p>A D3D11 compositor with multistream RTMP and GPU recording, plus cloud overlays and TalkiBot.</p>
        <div class="chips"><span class="chip">D3D11</span><span class="chip">RTMP</span><span class="chip">Overlays</span></div>
      </article>
      <article class="card tile t-4" data-r style="--d: 160ms">
        <h3>Mobile</h3>
        <p>An iOS and Android app on the same backend as the desktop client.</p>
        <div class="chips"><span class="chip">React Native</span><span class="chip">Expo</span></div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
